WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.730
Green Claims Assurance reviews the environmental statements a brand makes in public, not just the data behind its suppliers.

2
00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:19.777
The process builds a claim inventory, maps each material assertion to records, factors, boundaries and method versions, then re-derives calculations and tests exclusions.

3
00:00:19.777 --> 00:00:29.126
Legal and sustainability teams receive a substantiation matrix, missing-data register and more precise wording where evidence is limited.

4
00:00:29.126 --> 00:00:35.988
The service provides technical and evidence assurance, not legal advice or company-wide certification.

5
00:00:35.988 --> 00:00:44.711
It cannot promise immunity from challenges, enforcement or litigation, and unsupported claims may receive a documented refusal.
